{"attack":"当对手未携带道具时，能够将自己携带的道具交给对手。","description":"使用者在本次战斗中将携带物品给予目标。\n\n如果目标拥有携带物品，则招式使用失败。\n不能给予Ｚ纯晶或邮件。涉及到形态变化的道具（例如超级石）通常也不能给予。\n如果使用者具有黏着特性或目标处于替身状态，此招式使用失败。\n除非是在野生对战中，否则给予的物品在战斗结束后还原。\n在野生对战中，给予野生宝可梦的道具会永久丢失，除非将该宝可梦收服。\n传递礼物一定会命中，除非目标正在使用蓄力的招式并不在场地上。","levelUpMoves":[],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":[],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Pikachu","Pikachu form:belle","Pikachu form:cosplay","Pikachu form:phd","Pikachu form:popstar","Pikachu form:rockstar","Pikachu form:libre","Raichu","Raichu form:alolan","Clefairy","Clefable","Exeggcute","Exeggutor","Exeggutor form:alolan","Chansey","Pichu","Pichu form:spiky","Togepi","Togetic","Delibird","Blissey","Zigzagoon","Linoone","Plusle","Tropius","Pachirisu","Togekiss","Pidove","Tranquill","Unfezant","Audino","Froakie","Frogadier","Greninja","Greninja form:battle_bond","Phantump","Trevenant","Pumpkaboo","Gourgeist","Cutiefly","Ribombee","Passimian","Pyukumuku"],"tmMoves9":[],"tmMoves8":[],"tmMoves7":[],"tmMoves6":[],"tmMoves5":[],"tmMoves4":[],"tmMoves3":[],"tmMoves2":[],"tmMoves1":[],"tmMoves":[]}